{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47796","headline":"授马氏女诗 · 黄冠野夫","name":"授马氏女诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"女是寄生枝，男是冬青木。\n冬青驾白鹅，寄生跨黄鹿。\n若遇寇相凌，稳便抛家族。\n早早上三清，莫候丹砂熟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄冠野夫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}